oads/origins/51f02dd4-e7e9-405d-a61f-25afb448b28b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5f4d23d2b2a167ba808dc0098d482d1a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8ed47d2/uploads/origins/51f02dd4-e7e9-405d-a61f-25afb448b28b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ebb217146ff942ac86de44f8489284f5 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f8ed47d2/uploads/origins/51f02dd4-e7e9-405d-a61f-25afb448b28b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7eddb04ec0bef57ddfd2c6e929ee38e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f8ed47d2/uploads/origins/51f02dd4-e7e9-405d-a61f-25afb448b28b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=c7eddb04ec0bef57ddfd2c6e929ee38e, https://si.imgix.net/f8ed47d2/uploads/origins/51f02dd4-e7e9-405d-a61f-25afb448b28b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=a63a6e3f67458921208f05b2855d05ac 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f8ed47d2/uploads/origins/51f02dd4-e7e9-405d-a61f-25afb448b28b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a836bb159b8a669ebdb334fbb3e9ace 3x"}, "body": "こんにちわ、前回は素敵な漫画ありがとうございました。\n今回依頼したいのは、同じくミリオンライブの矢吹可奈ちゃんのイラストです。\nSSR「昨日の悪友は今日の、」衣装[トゥインクル・メイジ]を着てそよ風吹く草原でホウキを片手に、キリッとした表情で立っている姿をお願いしたいです。\n\n参考資料\nhttps://imas.gamedbs.jp/mlth/chara/show/36/977\nhttps://mltd.matsurihi.me/cards/962\nhttps://theaterdays.xyz/archives/24534920.html\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@OtetoOte/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 1199608, "client_id": 63695, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4447e503/uploads/origins/635277dc-6da6-4096-997a-8aeaf168c330?bg=%23fff&auto=for